{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi everyone!<br>I'm Andreas, and I'm so happy to finally present my first ever released game.<br>This project has been really fun, and I look forward to any feedback I receive which I am commited to use to further improve the gameplay, and make it as enjoyable as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unearth History, build a Museum, uncover a Secret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve just been hired as the <strong>museum manager</strong> for a prestigious yet mysterious institution. Your job? <strong>Travel across remote islands</strong>, dig up <strong>ancient artifacts</strong>, and curate the most impressive museum the world has ever seen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore, Dig, and Discover</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel </strong>to different islands, each hiding unique artifacts waiting to be unearthed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your tools</strong> to become more efficient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean and showcase</strong> your findings to attract visitors and earn income.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig &amp; Discover:</strong> Hunt for rare artifacts across a variety of islands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Museum Tycoon Lite:</strong> Place, display, and grow your museum for more visitors &amp; income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Tools:</strong> Better gear gives higher efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements &amp; Cloud Saves</strong> (Planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Mystery to Unravel:</strong> The more you dig, the <strong>darker the truth becomes\u2026</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568150?t=1743119004","ba